---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="页面未找到 · 404" description="您访问的页面不存在或已移动。">
  <section class="max-w-content mx-auto px-4 py-20 text-center">
    <p class="text-6xl font-bold text-primary mb-4">404</p>
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3 text-ink">页面未找到</h1>
    <p class="text-gray-600 mb-8">
      您访问的页面可能已移动、删除，或从未存在。
    </p>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
      <a
        href="/"
        class="inline-block px-6 py-2 bg-primary text-white rounded hover:opacity-90 hover:no-underline text-sm"
      >
        ← 返回首页
      </a>
      <a
        href="/search/"
        class="inline-block px-6 py-2 border border-gray-300 text-ink rounded hover:bg-paper-dark hover:no-underline text-sm"
      >
        🔍 站内搜索
      </a>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-12 text-sm text-gray-500 italic">
      "前途是光明的，道路是曲折的。"
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
